{
  "title": "CloudFront · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "엣지에서 정적·동적 콘텐츠를 전달하는 CDN이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>CloudFront</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#distribution-and-origin\">Distribution and Origin</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#cache-behaviors\">Cache Behaviors</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#cache-policy-and-cache-key\">Cache Policy and Cache Key</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#ttl-and-invalidation\">TTL and Invalidation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#origin-access-control\">Origin Access Control</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#signed-urls-and-signed-cookies\">Signed URLs and Signed Cookies</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#tls-waf-and-geo-restriction\">TLS, WAF and Geo Restriction</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#cloudfront-functions-and-lambda-edge\">CloudFront Functions and Lambda@Edge</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#origin-shield-and-logging\">Origin Shield and Logging</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>09 / 62</span></div><h1>CloudFront</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 9 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>CloudFront는 콘텐츠와 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 요청을 글로벌 Edge Network에서 제공하는 CDN이다. 정적 파일은 Cache로 빠르게 제공하고 동적 요청은 구성된 Origin으로 전달한다.</p><p>배포의 성능과 데이터 격리는 Cache Key와 권한 설계에 달려 있다. 사용자별 응답을 공통 Cache Key에 넣으면 다른 사용자에게 잘못된 데이터를 제공할 위험이 있다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Viewer·Cache·Origin 경계\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Viewer·Cache·Origin 경계</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Public delivery</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Viewer HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span></strong><small>Viewer Certificate</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>CloudFront</strong><small>Cache Behavior·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Origin</strong><small>Miss 또는 동적 요청</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Private S3 origin</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>CloudFront</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#origin-access-control\">Origin Access Control</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\">Bucket Policy</a></strong><small>지정 Distribution 허용</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private Object</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 직접 공개 불필요</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Signed URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span>·Cookie는 Viewer 접근, OAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Origin Access Control)</span>는 Origin 접근을 제어한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"distribution-and-origin\"><h2>Distribution and Origin<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#distribution-and-origin\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Distribution은 도메인, Origin, 보안·Cache 동작을 묶은 배포 설정이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>, HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> Server 등을 Origin으로 지정한다. Origin Group을 사용하면 지원 조건의 Origin Failover를 구성할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cache-behaviors\"><h2>Cache Behaviors<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#cache-behaviors\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span> Path Pattern별로 Origin, 허용 Method, Viewer Protocol Policy와 Cache 설정을 선택한다. 정적 경로와 개인화 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>의 Cache 조건을 분리할 수 있다. 우선순위와 Default Behavior가 실제 요청에 어떻게 적용되는지 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cache-policy-and-cache-key\"><h2>Cache Policy and Cache Key<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#cache-policy-and-cache-key\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Cache Key에 들어갈 Query String·Header·Cookie와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>을 정의한다. 불필요한 값은 Cache Hit를 낮추고 필요한 값을 제외하면 잘못된 응답을 공유할 수 있다. Origin Request Policy는 Origin으로 보낼 추가 값의 전달을 다룬다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ttl-and-invalidation\"><h2>TTL <span class=\"full-name\">(Time to Live)</span> and Invalidation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#ttl-and-invalidation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>은 Cache의 유효 기간을, Invalidation은 기존 Cache 객체 제거를 제어한다. 버전이 있는 파일 이름으로 새 객체를 배포하면 오래된 Cache와 충돌을 줄일 수 있다. Invalidation 요청 비용과 전파 시간을 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"origin-access-control\"><h2>Origin Access Control<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#origin-access-control\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>OAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Origin Access Control)</span>로 지원 Origin 접근을 CloudFront 요청에 제한할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\">Bucket Policy</a>도 함께 구성해야 하며 공개 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>으로 둘 필요가 없다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Website Endpoint와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span> Origin은 접근 방식이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"signed-urls-and-signed-cookies\"><h2>Signed URLs <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locators)</span> and Signed Cookies<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#signed-urls-and-signed-cookies\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Viewer가 Private 콘텐츠를 볼 수 있는 권한·기간을 제한한다. Signed URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span>은 특정 URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span> 접근, Signed Cookie는 여러 파일 접근에 유용하다. Origin의 OAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Origin Access Control)</span>는 Viewer 권한을 대신하는 기능이 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"tls-waf-and-geo-restriction\"><h2>TLS <span class=\"full-name\">(Transport Layer Security)</span>, WAF <span class=\"full-name\">(Web Application Firewall)</span> and Geo Restriction<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#tls-waf-and-geo-restriction\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Viewer와 Origin의 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span> 정책을 각각 설정한다. CloudFront용 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">ACM</a> Certificate의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 요구사항을 확인한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/#web-acls-and-rules\">Web ACL</a>과 지리 제한은 접근 필터를 제공하지만 Cache Key와 Origin 권한도 별도로 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cloudfront-functions-and-lambda-edge\"><h2>CloudFront Functions and Lambda@Edge<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#cloudfront-functions-and-lambda-edge\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>CloudFront Functions는 경량 Viewer 요청·응답 변환에 적합하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>@Edge는 지원 Event에서 더 복잡한 처리를 수행한다. Runtime·실행 시간·Network 접근 등 기능 차이와 배포 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 제약을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"origin-shield-and-logging\"><h2>Origin Shield and Logging<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#origin-shield-and-logging\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#origin-shield\">Origin Shield</a>는 Origin에 도달하는 중복 요청을 더 줄이는 Cache 계층이다. Access Logs·Metrics로 Cache Hit와 오류를 분석한다. Cache 개선이 Origin 자체의 고가용성이나 용량 설계를 대체하지는 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>의 교육 동영상은 OAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Origin Access Control)</span>로 Origin을 보호하고 Signed URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span>로 수강생 접근 기간을 제한하며 CloudFront Cache로 반복 전송을 줄인다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 선택을 하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>과 콘텐츠를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>·전달하는 CloudFront를 구별한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/Introduction.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/Introduction.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-s3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/private-content-restricting-access-to-s3.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q003\" data-question=\"Q003\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q003</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce static image download latency for users worldwide and lower requests to its origin server. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q003\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS snapshots</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">엣지</a>에 콘텐츠를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 사용자 가까이 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">Edge Location</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q082\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q082\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q090\" data-question=\"Q090\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q090</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q090/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which TWO services should be considered to mitigate malicious web requests and DDoS attacks in front of CloudFront?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Shield</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS WAF</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q090\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DMS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF</a>는 웹 요청 규칙, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">Shield</a>는 DDoS <span class=\"full-name\">(Distributed Denial of Service)</span> 보호에 중점을 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">WAF / Shield</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q017\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q083\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet&#x27;s route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q083\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cf/\">이전 용어 <b>CloudFormation</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">다음 용어 <b>CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
